    # robin "You fell asleep peacefully while I was fucking terrified!"
    robin "내가 겁에 질려 있는 동안 당신은 평화롭게 잠들었어요!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3443
translate korean ending3_649402e9:

    # pro "But you said I could... I couldn't have known that-"
    pro "하지만 당신은 내가 할 수 있다고 말했어요... 난 그걸 알 수 없었을 거에요-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3444
translate korean ending3_5c0f6f20:

    # robin "Then maybe I shouldn't have trusted you in the first place..."
    robin "그렇다면 애초에 당신을 믿지 말았어야 했는데..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3445
translate korean ending3_8e4832b1:

    # robin "You could have gotten me killed..."
    robin "너라면 날 죽일 수도 있었어..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3446
translate korean ending3_0351b29e:

    # robin "You could have gotten yourself killed..."
    robin "스스로 목숨을 잃을 수도 있었어..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3447
translate korean ending3_7cd0ed14:

    # robin "And not to mention how violent you got with him..."
    robin "그리고 당신이 그 사람에게 얼마나 폭력적인 행동을 했는지는 말할 것도 없고..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3448
translate korean ending3_a593398b:

    # robin "You... your hands were all bloody."
    robin "너... 네 손은 온통 피투성이였어."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3449
translate korean ending3_064835f3:

    # pro "I didn't mean to... I didn't even realize I was..."
    pro "그럴 의도는 아니었는데... 나도 몰랐는데..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3450
translate korean ending3_443a072e:

    # pro "I blacked out and when I came to, the cops were-"
    pro "정신을 잃었고 정신을 차렸을 때 경찰은-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3451
translate korean ending3_2418ba72:

    # robin "I'm leaving."
    robin "나는 떠난다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3453
translate korean ending3_14e5965e:

    # robin "I'm moving out and going somewhere else."
    robin "이사하고 다른 데로 갈 거예요."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3454
translate korean ending3_cc59e536:

    # robin "I... I can't stay with you any more."
    robin "나... 더 이상 당신과 함께 있을 수 없어요."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3455
translate korean ending3_5046e8ff:

    # robin "You broke my trust... I can't anymore."
    robin "당신은 내 신뢰를 깨뜨렸습니다... 더 이상 그럴 수 없습니다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3456
translate korean ending3_5009e319:

    # robin "I'm sorry."
    robin "죄송합니다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3457
translate korean ending3_c4911750:

    # "I'm stunned. I don't know what to say."
    "나는 깜짝 놀랐다. 무슨 말을 해야할지 모르겠습니다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3458
translate korean ending3_05a42722:

    # robin "I'm going to stay at a motel tonight. Don't bother trying to contact me."
    robin "오늘 밤에는 모텔에 묵을 예정이에요. 나한테 연락하려고 애쓰지 마세요."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3459
translate korean ending3_a5c35f8d:

    # robin "I'll be back for my stuff tomorrow..."
    robin "내일 짐 찾으러 다시 올게요..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3460
translate korean ending3_39e01fef:

    # robin "I can pay for the damages to the door you broke too."
    robin "당신이 깨뜨린 문에 대한 피해도 제가 배상할 수 있어요."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3461
translate korean ending3_82353b83:

    # pro "Robin... no..."
    pro "Robin... no..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3462
translate korean ending3_ecd229c2:

    # pro "I was... I was just..."
    pro "난... 난 그냥..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3464
translate korean ending3_ed23f47e:

    # "Without another word, he turns around and leaves."
    "그는 더 이상 아무 말도 없이 돌아서서 떠난다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3465
translate korean ending3_d0157b79:

    # "I'm alone... again..."
    "나 혼자야... 또..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3466
translate korean ending3_f05b010b:

    # "And this time it's my fault..."
    "그리고 이번엔 내 잘못이야..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3467
translate korean ending3_5aef4a4b:

    # "I failed him..."
    "나는 그에게 실패했다..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3468
translate korean ending3_e7c39007:

    # "I told him to trust me..."
    "나는 그에게 나를 믿으라고 말했습니다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3469
translate korean ending3_050bae79:

    # "If maybe I had stayed up with him... or even just ran away with him."
    "내가 그 사람과 함께 있었더라면... 아니면 그냥 그 사람과 함께 도망갔을 수도 있었을 텐데."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3470
translate korean ending3_d3121992:

    # "This wouldn't have happened."
    "이런 일은 일어나지 않았을 것입니다."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3472
translate korean ending3_faa87652:

    # "I... I don't even know what to think."
    "나... 어떻게 생각해야 할지 모르겠어."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3473
translate korean ending3_b39c2d35:

    # "What do I do now...?"
    "이제 어떻게 해야 할까요...?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3474
translate korean ending3_52323f8f:

    # "Was this the end of things?"
    "이게 모든 일의 끝이었나요?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3475
translate korean ending3_60a1cb87:

    # "I guess so..."
    "그럴 것 같아요..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3476
translate korean ending3_806de563:

    # "I'm... I'm horrible."
    "난... 난 정말 끔찍해요."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3481
translate korean ending3_db2c0ffe:

    # system "Ending 3 Complete"
    system "엔딩 3 완료"

